        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>MNG 216, Laguna 7-1/2 Inch Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Laguna 7-1/2 Inch Cabinet Pull is modern and sleek. This easy to care for kitchen cabinet pull has 7-1/2 inch mounting centers and measures 8 inches overall. The Modern Silver Drawer Pull is available in polished chrome or satin nickel finish. Each of the Laguna 192mm Pulls comes packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet pull is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=MNG+Laguna\">MNG Laguna Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the MNG 216 Laguna 7-1/2 Inch Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Base Material: Zinc </li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 7-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screws and 1-1/2\"  long #8-32 screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i> \r\n</p>",
